  "StatusBadge / CountBadge / LabelTag / GdsBadgeShapeCircle / GdsBadgeShapeSquircle / GdsBadgeShapeHexagon / GdsBadgeShapeShield / GdsBadgeShapeRosette / GdsBadgeShapePin / GdsBadge / GdsBadgeStack / GdsBadgeStackLayer / GdsCountBadge / GdsRemovableTag / GdsIconBadge / GdsVibeThemeScope / GdsMapPinBadge / GdsIconStyleContext (SportsEmojiModeDemo scopes the badge glyph mode directly; useGdsBadgeIconStyle is exercised internally by GdsBadge/GdsMapPinBadge whenever that demo renders) / GdsSavedIndicator / GdsCompareButton / GdsRatingDisplay": "StatusBadge / CountBadge / LabelTag / GdsBadgeShapeCircle / GdsBadgeShapeSquircle / GdsBadgeShapeHexagon / GdsBadgeShapeShield / GdsBadgeShapeRosette / GdsBadgeShapePin / GdsBadge / GdsBadgeStack / GdsBadgeStackLayer / GdsCountBadge / GdsRemovableTag / GdsIconBadge / GdsVibeThemeScope / GdsMapPinBadge / GdsIconStyleContext (SportsEmojiModeDemo scopes the badge glyph mode directly; useGdsBadgeIconStyle is exercised internally by GdsBadge/GdsMapPinBadge whenever that demo renders) / GdsSavedIndicator / GdsCompareButton / GdsRatingDisplay",
